%% Phase4 / timeline / G-10 latest bounded timeline
%% Helix owners: query/local_first.rs; event/timeline.rs; port_reply/dispatch_read.rs
%% 当前生产出口是 im:timeline:ready + im:timeline:update；旧 im:messages:query_result 仅作 drift 记录。
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: queryMessages({channelId,limit,anchor})
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_query_messages_by_channel", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_query_messages_by_channel", payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_query_messages_by_channel", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: validate channel, bounded limit, runtime generation, req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist Scan local timeline
  Host->>DB: query latest bounded rows + coverage/token
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(local rows, coverage)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(local scan)
  alt local coverage complete
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet rows/channel
    Host->>DB: readback ordered absolute page
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:ready(window,token,state=ready)
  else local coverage missing
    IM->>Host: Effect::Http GET channel sync/latest
    Host->>Go: HTTP timeline page request
    Go-->>Host: page + nextSeq/anchor metadata
    Host->>E: PortReply(remote page)
    E->>IM: continue same req_id/corr_key
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(page rows + cursor)
    Host->>DB: commit remote rows and cursor
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet latest bounded rows
    Host->>DB: readback after durable write
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:ready(window,token,state=ready)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:update(direction=replace)
  else HTTP/Persist failure
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:ready(req_id,state=failed,error)
  end
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ resolves query waiter and renders bounded window
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw timeline event bytes
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch v2 raw timeline event bytes
  Note over UI,Web: UI 只消费绝对 window/token；不在 shell 侧 merge rows、补 unread 或生成导航 directive。
